Z||000022||2birds||02-20-2001||07:32 PM||||I work in the propulsion plant of a nuclear submarine, and we get some of the worst coffee in the world.  I make it palatable by adding two packets of Swiss Miss cocoa, at least 4 packets of sugar, and as much powdered creamer as I can get to dissolve.<BR>If I have one at the beginning of a six hour watch, it'll usually carry me through to the end.  <BR>Not always necessary, but some days you just don't get much sleep (Gotta make sure the taxpayers get their money's worth out of me).||||reg||1
